      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CELIA.\nI pray you, one of you question yond man\nIf he for gold will give us any food.\nI faint almost to death.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
