      },
      "speakerLabel": "CORIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55172",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROSALIND.\nWhat is he that shall buy his flock and pasture?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55172/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55172/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 585547,
        "end": 585635,
        "line": 22013,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@55172",
        "anchor": "sceneII_4.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROSALIND.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55264",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CORIN.\nThat young swain that you saw here but erewhile,\nThat little cares for buying anything.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55264/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55264/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 55,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55264/line-3",
          "start": 56,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 585639,
        "end": 585768,
        "line": 22018,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@55264",
        "anchor": "sceneII_4.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CORIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55397",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROSALIND.\nI pray thee, if it stand with honesty,\nBuy thou the cottage, pasture, and the flock,\nAnd thou shalt have to pay for it of us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55397/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55397/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55397/line-3",
          "start": 49,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55397/line-4",
          "start": 95,
          "end": 135,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 585772,
        "end": 585947,
        "line": 22024,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@55397",
        "anchor": "sceneII_4.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ROSALIND.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55576",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CELIA.\nAnd we will mend thy wages. I like this place,\nAnd willingly could waste my time in it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55576/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55576/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55576/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 585951,
        "end": 586080,
        "line": 22031,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap04/p@55576",
        "anchor": "sceneII_4.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CELIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "as-you-like-it/sceneII_4.4/p@55709",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CORIN.\nAssuredly the thing is to be sold.\nGo with me. If you like upon report\nThe soil, the profit, and this kind of life,\nI will your very faithful feeder be,\nAnd buy it with your gold right suddenly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
